/
TITLE : 'donau-tweaked-for-BAL-FV'
/
VARIABLES FOR GRAPHIC PRINTOUTS             : 'U,V,S,B,H,M,W'
/
/TIME STEP                                   : 0.01
/
/NUMBER OF TIME STEPS                        :  2000
/GRAPHIC PRINTOUT PERIOD                     :  1000
/LISTING PRINTOUT PERIOD                     :  200
/
/ SSC adaptations for FV
VARIABLE TIME-STEP: YES
DURATION: 5000
GRAPHIC PRINTOUT PERIOD : 100
LISTING PRINTOUT PERIOD : 100
/
/------------------------------------------------------------------/
/			NUMERICAL PARAMETERS
/------------------------------------------------------------------/
/ General solver parameters - see section 7.1
/DISCRETIZATIONS IN SPACE : 11;11 / default 11 - kept because uncertain compatibility with T2d
/FREE SURFACE GRADIENT COMPATIBILITY : 0.02 / default is 1.
ADVECTION : YES
/
/ Enable FV to yield mass and momentum conservation
/ FV examples in telemac2d folder - malpasset - friction
EQUATIONS : 'SAINT-VENANT FV' / the apostrophes are strictly needed here!
/
/ STABILITY CONTROLS - PARAMETERS FOR MASS CONSERVATION
PRINTING CUMULATED FLOWRATES : YES
OPTION FOR DIRICHLET CONDITION IN FV DIFFUSION : 1 / enforce STRONG type - default is 1-weak
OPTION FOR THE DIFFUSION OF VELOCITIES : 2 / only option to get mass conservation but can cause problems with tidal flats
SCHEME FOR ADVECTION OF VELOCITIES : 3 / use 3, also for FV - MATRIX STORAGE must be 3
MATRIX STORAGE : 3 
CONTINUITY CORRECTION : YES
SCHEME OPTION FOR ADVECTION OF VELOCITIES : 4 / overrides SUPG OPTION and OPTION FOR CHARACTERISTICS
NUMBER OF CORRECTIONS OF DISTRIBUTIVE SCHEMES : 2 / increase for higher accuracy and longer computing time, requires SCHEME OF ADVECTION 3,4,5, or 15 and OPTION 2,3,4
TYPE OF SOURCES : 2 / 2=Dirc is the only possibility for mass conservations, the default=1 means linear function and is not mass conservative
/SECTIONS INPUT FILE : control-sections.txt
/SECTIONS OUTPUT FILE: control-sections-output.txt
/
CONTROL OF LIMITS : YES / avoids divergence - default is NO
/LIMIT VALUES : -1000;9000;-1000;1000;-1000;1000;-1000;1000 / integer list for min max of H, U, V, tracer
/
/ SCHEME PARAMETERS - section 7.2.2 in the manual
/------------------------------------------------------------------
FINITE VOLUME SCHEME : 5 / kinetic scheme = 1 (is default), 5 = HLLC
FINITE VOLUME SCHEME SPACE ORDER = 1
FINITE VOLUME SCHEME TIME ORDER  = 2
MASS-BALANCE                     = YES
/H CLIPPING                       = NO
DESIRED COURANT NUMBER : 0.8 / must be smaller-equal 0.9
DESIRED FOURIER NUMBER : 0.9 / must be defined smaller 1 for stability of FV
/STOP IF A STEADY STATE IS REACHED : YES / default is NO
/STOP CRITERIA : 1.E-6;1.E-6;1.E-6 / for U,V,T
FINITE VOLUME SCHEME FOR VELOCITY DIFFUSION : 3 / use 3 (RTPF) for better conservation
OPTION OF THE HYDROSTATIC RECONSTRUCTION = 2 / for stability with FV from the telemac forum to combine with FV SCHEME = 5
/
